+# litert_edge_demos patch: no LiteRT runtime from this plugin on Linux.
+# flutter_edge_ai_litertlm ships libLiteRt.so and libLiteRtWebGpuAccelerator.so
+# for x86_64 and arm64 (glibc 2.35) as native assets with the same file names;
+# they used to overwrite this plugin's x86_64-only copies in bundle/lib anyway.
+# CompiledModel binds to that runtime (lib/src/bindings/litert_ffi.dart picks
+# the model-loading ABI from the library). The TFLite C library (Interpreter,
+# the CPU reference in verifyCompiledModel) is x86_64-only and needs glibc 2.38;
+# it is bundled on x86_64, and where it cannot load the app verifies against
+# LiteRT's CPU path instead.
